{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610312016226382153678268d9d6mXjLNXcO","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_4cbc4c5e85354623bfa6e5df52ab43ac","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === \"0:1\" || p.name.includes(\"00\"));\n  if (!page) return \"Page 00 not found\";\n  \n  function getStructure(node, depth = 0) {\n    let result = \"  \".repeat(depth) + `[${node.type}] ${node.name}`;\n    if (node.type === \"TEXT\") {\n      result += `: \"${node.characters.replace(/\\n/g, \"\\\\n\")}\"`;\n    }\n    result += \"\\n\";\n    if (\"children\" in node && depth < 5) {\n      for (const child of node.children) {\n        result += getStructure(child, depth + 1);\n      }\n    }\n    return result;\n  }\n  \n  return getStructure(page);\n})()\n","description":"Extract full text structure from page 00 Start Here","fileKey":"oJ0khyrOsFgMq3cINEL7So"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11127,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a48cb58e-c22d-4383-99f1-d8ee15e74b04","uuid":"2784b49f-0efd-493a-bb74-f2f7b192e420","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:16:27.779Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_4cbc4c5e85354623bfa6e5df52ab43ac","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_4cbc4c5e85354623bfa6e5df52ab43ac","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[PAGE] 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n  [FRAME] Start Here · Brief\n    [FRAME] Header\n      [TEXT] LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2: \"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\"\n      [TEXT] Payment Wallet — pay, manage, grow: \"Payment Wallet — pay, manage, grow\"\n      [TEXT] Design a mobile payment wallet: onboard, start with a phone number, see your bank balances and recent transactions, and reach the main areas from the side menu. Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.: \"Design a mobile payment wallet: onboard, start with a phone number, see your bank balances and recent transactions, and reach the main areas from the side menu. Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\"\n    [FRAME] How to work\n      [TEXT] How to work: \"How to work\"\n      [TEXT] 1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator, system numeric keypad). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustration, avatars, bank and merchant marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.: \"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator, system numeric keypad). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the illustration, avatars, bank and merchant marks and icons from 04 · Media.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\"\n    [FRAME] Frames · goals · must include · links\n      [TEXT] Frames · goals · must include · links: \"Frames · goals · must include · links\"\n      [TEXT] Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.: \"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\"\n      [FRAME] Frame cards\n        [FRAME] 01_Onboarding\n          [TEXT] 01_Onboarding: \"01_Onboarding\"\n          [TEXT] Goal: Understand the app and choose to start.: \"Goal: Understand the app and choose to start.\"\n          [TEXT] MUST INCLUDE: \"MUST INCLUDE\"\n          [TEXT] • Actions: “Get Started” · “Sign in” • Copy: “Pay / Manage / Grow…” (one word per line) · “An easy app to manage all your payment and finance-related needs” · “Already have an account?” • Media: Illustration_Onboarding: \"• Actions: “Get Started” · “Sign in”\\n• Copy: “Pay / Manage / Grow…” (one word per line) · “An easy app to manage all your payment and finance-related needs” · “Already have an account?”\\n• Media: Illustration_Onboarding\"\n          [TEXT] LINKS: \"LINKS\"\n          [TEXT] → Get Started → 02_Phone_Number: \"→ Get Started → 02_Phone_Number\"\n        [FRAME] 02_Phone_Number\n          [TEXT] 02_Phone_Number: \"02_Phone_Number\"\n          [TEXT] Goal: Enter a phone number to get started.: \"Goal: Enter a phone number to get started.\"\n          [TEXT] MUST INCLUDE: \"MUST INCLUDE\"\n          [TEXT] • Actions: “Cancel” · “Get Started” • Form: “Phone Number” · country code +91 · empty (placeholder 9812345678) · focused • Header: “Get Started” · “Please enter the mobile phone number” • Keyboard: system numeric keypad open (Numeric Keypad) • Presentation: sheet over 01_Onboarding: \"• Actions: “Cancel” · “Get Started”\\n• Form: “Phone Number” · country code +91 · empty (placeholder 9812345678) · focused\\n• Header: “Get Started” · “Please enter the mobile phone number”\\n• Keyboard: system numeric keypad open (Numeric Keypad)\\n• Presentation: sheet over 01_Onboarding\"\n          [TEXT] LINKS: \"LINKS\"\n          [TEXT] → Get Started → 03_Home → Cancel → 01_Onboarding: \"→ Get Started → 03_Home\\n→ Cancel → 01_Onboarding\"\n        [FRAME] 03_Home\n          [TEXT] 03_Home: \"03_Home\"\n          [TEXT] Goal: Check my balances, move money and see recent transactions.: \"Goal: Check my balances, move money and see recent transactions.\"\n          [TEXT] MUST INCLUDE: \"MUST INCLUDE\"\n          [TEXT] • Accounts: Axis Bank · HDFC Bank · Deutsche Bank · Union Bank, each with its mark and balance (see DATA) • Actions: “Send” (Icon_Send) · “Receive” (Icon_Receive) · refresh balance (Icon_Refresh) · “Transaction History” · “Scan any QR” (Icon_Scan) • Balance: Bank_HSBC · “Last Updated Balance” · ₹85,625 · “Prim