{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610312017311543521628268d9d6nNzTwYh3","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_8607bf98e0ad489b8daf8d80837db198","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const p02 = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === \"1:3\");\n  const button = p02.findOne(node => node.name === \"Button\" && node.type === \"COMPONENT\");\n  const textField = p02.findOne(node => node.name === \"Text Field\" && node.type === \"COMPONENT\");\n  \n  function getPropDesc(node) {\n    if (!node) return \"not found\";\n    let desc = `[${node.type}] ${node.name}\\n`;\n    if (\"children\" in node) {\n      for (const child of node.children) {\n        desc += `  - [${child.type}] ${child.name}`;\n        if (child.type === \"TEXT\") {\n          desc += `: \"${child.characters.replace(/\\n/g, \"\\\\n\")}\"`;\n        }\n        if (child.fills && child.fills.length > 0) {\n          desc += ` fill:${JSON.stringify(child.fills[0])}`;\n        }\n        desc += \"\\n\";\n      }\n    }\n    return desc;\n  }\n  \n  return {\n    button: getPropDesc(button),\n    textField: getPropDesc(textField)\n  };\n})()\n","description":"Inspect styles and details of Button and Text Field components in Page 02.","fileKey":"oJ0khyrOsFgMq3cINEL7So"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":18163,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":13809},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a48cb58e-c22d-4383-99f1-d8ee15e74b04","uuid":"d4c6719f-3ebf-4448-ac42-73d65f6438cd","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:17:35.854Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_8607bf98e0ad489b8daf8d80837db198","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
